<title>RUSSIA: Russia T-bill tax guidelines expected on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Russia T-bill tax guidelines expected on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A leading Russian Central Banker said he expected guidelines for the application of profit taxes on government securities to be published on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect explanation of the profits tax law according to the new rules today,&quot; Deputy Chairman Andrei Kozlov told Reuters.</p>
<p>Russia extended a profits tax to Treasury Bill earnings on Tuesday with the official publication of an amendment to the profits tax law.</p>
<p>Kozlov said the law would tax GKO discount Treasury bill and OFZ government bond earnings at 35-43 percent, instead of the 15 percent rate the market expected.</p>
<p>He said the laws would not affect securities issued before Tuesday.</p>
</text>
